   "en": "{07 16 00}I'm sorry, but{01 00 00 05 00} I just don't\nfeel like talking to anyone\nnow.{01 00 00 14 00} {07 0f 00}{01 00 00 0a 00}Sigh{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}.",
