  },
  {
   "id": 2,
   "en": "{07 1c 00}{01 00 00 05 00}Oh{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00} This is just\nso terrible, {04 02 00}. I\ndon't understand{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}\n{07 16 00}Why did this have to happen\nto me? {07 08 00}What have I\ndone{01 00 00 05 00} to deserve this?",
   "et": "{07 1c 00}{01 00 00 05 00}Oh{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00} See on lihtsalt\nnii kohutav, {04 02 00}. Ma\nei mõista{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}\n{07 16 00}Miks see pidi juhtuma\njust minuga? {07 08 00}Mida ma olen\nteinud{01 00 00 05 00}, et seda väärida?"
  },
  {
   "id": 3,
   "en": "{07 0f 00}{01 00 00 0a 00}Sometimes,{01 00 00 05 00} I just wonder,\n\"What's the point?\"{01 00 00 14 00} I've had\na bad day, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}.",
   "et": "{07 0f 00}{01 00 00 0a 00}Vahel{01 00 00 05 00} ma lihtsalt mõtlen:\n„Mis mõte sellel on?”{01 00 00 14 00} Mul on\nolnud halb päev, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}."
  },
  {
   "id": 4,
   "en": "{07 06 00}Awww{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 01 00} {07 0f 00}{01 00 00 0a 00}Why, oh, why do I\nhave to be{01 00 00 0a 00} the star of\nthis tragedy{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.",
